 a different input to the same decision function, which only differs in names and leads. Since the algorithm ignores names, I'm concluding that the two nodes compute the same output, so there is an edge between them.\n\nCooperating yields a payoff of 2 against 4 for defecting, so I'm passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8240,"completion_tokens":591,"total_tokens":8831,"cost":0.04478,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.04478,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03296,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01182},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":171,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}